{"id":"HAD-0153","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Buraydah ibn al-Ḥuṣayb berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"**Wer das ʿAṣr-Gebet unterlässt, dessen Taten werden zunichte.**","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Nr. 553","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":null}